* -dialect=c32: junk after a set or equ value is ignored, as C 3.2's R68 does
* (x set x+obj_sz*2(a0),a0).
* fixed: 4283498 2026-10-10 r68togas, rof2elf, m68k-os9-r68, os9link: corpus fixes; l68's PC-relative error
* options: -dialect=c32
* expect text: 0008 0003
 psect c32_set_junk,0,0,0,0,0
obj_sz equ 2
x set 4
x set x+obj_sz*2(a0),a0
y equ 3 junk
 dc.w x,y
 ends
